      "content": "i know you say that, but it doesn't feel that way. it feels like i'm stealing his life. he used to be so active, so free, and now he's just... tied to me. i see him looking at me sometimes and i just know he's thinking about how much easier everything would be if he didn't have to worry about me anymore. if i wasn't even here to be a problem.",
